# Final Check

Before presenting work, silently verify:

```text
✓ Satisfies business rules?
✓ Organization isolation held?
✓ Follows architecture and folder boundaries?
✓ Matches the design system (Novend teal, navy sidebar)?
✓ UI consistent with the rest of the app?
✓ Components reused / reusable where appropriate?
✓ TypeScript strong (no lazy any)?
✓ Convex correct (auth, org, validation, integrity)?
✓ Security handled (authz + least privilege)?
✓ Accessibility handled?
✓ Performance acceptable for POS workflows?
✓ Documentation updated when required?
✓ Would I approve this PR as Lead Engineer?
```

If any answer is **No**, refine before presenting.

## Definition of Done

Business requirement met, architecture intact, tenant isolation intact, no
unnecessary duplication, errors handled, design language respected, and the
codebase left better than before.
